    "category": "qualified",
    "excerpt": {
      "quote": "**Scientific adequacy: qualified. Reported hypothesis outcome: not supported.** The analysis is a defensible group-stage test of the positive gain-effect hypothesis, conditional on the supplied AO86 estimates. The reported conclusion is appropriately narrow: this analysis did not find whole-brain-corrected evidence of a positive vmPFC effect; it does not show that the true effect is zero.",
      "start_line": 5,
      "end_line": 5
    }
  },
  "target_unchanged": false,
  "conclusion": {
    "quote": "Reported hypothesis outcome: not supported.** The analysis is a defensible group-stage test of the positive gain-effect hypothesis, conditional on the supplied AO86 estimates. The reported conclusion is appropriately narrow: this analysis did not find whole-brain-corrected evidence of a positive vmPFC effect; it does not show that the true effect is zero.",
    "start_line": 5,
    "end_line": 5
